{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_0_level_main_00-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": "main_00-09",
  "title": "騎士",
  "storyCode": "0-9",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5eba46818942b03ea0912432fd2d6f0037c76898a813aad1ebe3d877ebfdabe9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "きゃっ――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "！　危ない！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "だ……大丈夫です、このくらい……かすり傷ですから……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "包囲網が、少しずつ狭まってきています……早くここから抜け出さないと……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "そうは言っても、今の人数では守りに入るしかない……！　包囲自体の突破口は見つけたが、増援がなければどうにもならんぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……わかりました。であれば、もう少しだけ耐えてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "敵方の先鋒には、我々――術師オペレーターが対応します！　みなさんは、狙撃手を優先的に攻撃してください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "アハハ！　いいねえ、その調子だ！　――F3からE5へ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "チッ、あのガキ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "素晴らしい！　そのまま行くよ！　――次はB4からB5だ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "！　敵が後方から回り込んできます！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "であれば、牽制を！　重装オペレーターを二人、狙撃オペレーターを一人、対応に回してください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "それじゃ、今度は――H2からH6！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "嘘……！？　あ、あの人たち、突撃してきますっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "っ、前衛オペレーター！　奴らを抑えろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "わお、いい表情するじゃないか。もっと苦しんで見せてよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "――さあ、今だ！　C7へ！　奴らのルークを蹴散らせ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "術師！？　一体どこから！？　――まさか、重装兵の背後に隠れて……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "ッ来るぞ、伏せろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "きゃああっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "ぐ、ッ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "――死ね、死ね！　雨に打たれる炎みたいに、惨めに消えろ！　アハハハハ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "っ……あんな指示で――チェスの駒でも動かすような一言で……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "粗暴な構成員たちをたった一人で制御して、あれほど正確な指揮を執るだなんて……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "このままでは、向こうに有利な展開へと持ち込まれて――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "少し見方を変えてみろ。あのガキが部隊の要なら、奴さえ抑えればどうとでもなるということだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "――総員、奴らに付け入る隙を与えるな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……クソッ……しかし何にせよ、時間がないぞ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ええ！　これ以上、足止めを喰らうわけにはいきません……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "何か……何か方法を見つけて、この状況を打開しなければ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ドクターや、みなさんの身に危険が……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "う、うわああああっ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "――えっ……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "……一体……何が起きてるんだ？　――僕の兵士が、吹き飛ばされた……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "あれは……何だ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――到着が遅いと思えば、こういうことか。お陰で、待ち時間のあいだに、市民の避難誘導まで済ませてしまったが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "！　その声は……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――さて、道を開けてもらおうか！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "うわっ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "皆、今だ！　敵が陣形を整える前に、一気に仕掛けるぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――ニアールさんっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "アーミヤ、無事で良かった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "ひとまず、話はあとだ。まずは撤退しよう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "ああ！　助かったぞ、ニアール。お前がいてくれてよかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "いいや、そちらが信号弾で正確な座標を教えてくれたおかげだ。……しかし、これは確かに厄介な状況だな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "ときに――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "あなたがDr.{@nickname}か？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――カジミエーシュの耀騎士（ようきし）、ニアール。あなたたちを迎えに参上した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
